{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Waky Alarm》是一款功能齊全的鬧鐘應用程式，專為有賴床困擾、難以有效清醒，或希望以更積極心態迎接一天的人士設計。它結合了創新的任務挑戰與激勵人心的每日名言，旨在幫助使用者告別昏沉，開啟充滿活力的一天。此應用程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-191.webp\">\n<h2>深度喚醒與專注功能</h2>\n<p>《Waky Alarm》獨特的「任務鬧鐘」功能，要求使用者完成指定任務才能關閉，有效防止賴床並徹底喚醒大腦。每日響鬧時，它會同步顯示一句激勵名言，為您注入正能量，開啟積極早晨。內建的「專注計時器」則有助您集中精神工作或學習，即使離開應用程式也能持續計時並適時提醒。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-643-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-644-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-645-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-646-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-647-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-648-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Waky Alarm – Start proud today</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:58:42.415875+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:33.746001+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:57:41.986477+00:00","content_hash":"ad9f28a09fcc60b6a45d5195e7ebecd065f484e5bd8ee3d29032bf25bf7ac855","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}